---
const brand = "JaiSellers Companies";
const divisions = [
  {
    label: "JSC",
    title: "JaiSellers Consulting",
    text: "Governance, 501(c)(3) formation, funding systems, board infrastructure, and operating rhythms for mission-driven organizations.",
    href: "/consulting",
  },
  {
    label: "JSD",
    title: "Design & Photography",
    text: "Brand identity, practical collateral, visual systems, photography, and digital presence work with clean structure and symbolic depth.",
    href: "/design",
  },
  {
    label: "JSI",
    title: "Just Systems Initiative",
    text: "A nonprofit organization in formation focused on education, reentry preparation, family connection, and justice-centered civic literacy.",
    href: "/jsi",
  },
];
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>{brand}</title>
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="JaiSellers Companies builds governance, funding, brand, and justice-centered systems for organizations doing public-benefit work."
    />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/site.css" />
    <style>
      :root {
        --paper: #f5f0e7;
        --ink: #101823;
        --soft-ink: #354151;
        --gold: #caa24a;
        --gold-deep: #9f7b27;
        --green: #2f4f46;
        --line-light: rgba(16, 24, 35, 0.13);
      }

      body {
        background: var(--paper);
        color: var(--ink);
      }

      .topbar {
        background: rgba(245, 240, 231, 0.9);
        border-bottom-color: var(--line-light);
      }

      .nav a {
        color: rgba(16, 24, 35, 0.74);
      }

      .nav a:hover,
      .nav-cta {
        color: var(--ink);
      }

      .nav-cta {
        border-color: rgba(159, 123, 39, 0.38);
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.48);
      }

      .home-hero {
        position: relative;
        min-height: calc(100svh - 92px);
        display: grid;
        align-items: center;
        overflow: hidden;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line-light);
        background:
          linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(245, 240, 231, 0.94) 0%, rgba(245, 240, 231, 0.78) 48%, rgba(16, 24, 35, 0.28) 100%),
          url("/images/AboutMe.png") right center / min(52vw, 720px) auto no-repeat,
          var(--paper);
      }

      .home-hero::before {
        content: "";
        position: absolute;
        inset: 0;
        pointer-events: none;
        background:
          linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent 82%, rgba(245, 240, 231, 0.96)),
          repeating-linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(16, 24, 35, 0.045) 0 1px, transparent 1px 120px);
      }

      .hero-inner {
        position: relative;
        width: min(1160px, calc(100% - 40px));
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: clamp(58px, 8vw, 104px) 0;
      }

      .kicker {
        color: var(--gold-deep);
        font-size: 12px;
        font-weight: 800;
        letter-spacing: 0.18em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        margin-bottom: 16px;
      }

      h1 {
        max-width: 12ch;
        color: var(--ink);
        font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
        font-size: clamp(52px, 8vw, 112px);
        line-height: 0.91;
        letter-spacing: 0;
      }

      .lead {
        max-width: 64ch;
        margin-top: 24px;
        color: var(--soft-ink);
        font-size: clamp(17px, 2vw, 21px);
        line-height: 1.55;
      }

      .cta-row {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 12px;
        margin-top: 28px;
      }

      .home-btn {
        display: inline-flex;
        min-height: 48px;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        padding: 12px 18px;
        border: 1px solid var(--line-light);
        border-radius: 2px;
        font-weight: 750;
        text-decoration: none;
      }

      .home-btn.primary {
        background: var(--ink);
        color: #fffaf0;
        border-color: var(--ink);
      }

      .home-btn.secondary {
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.56);
        color: var(--ink);
      }

      .section-light {
        padding: clamp(54px, 7vw, 86px) 0;
        background: #fffaf0;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line-light);
      }

      .section-muted {
        padding: clamp(54px, 7vw, 86px) 0;
        background: #ebe4d6;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line-light);
      }

      .home-container {
        width: min(1160px, calc(100% - 40px));
        margin: 0 auto;
      }

      .section-head {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 0.7fr 1.3fr;
        gap: 28px;
        align-items: end;
        margin-bottom: 28px;
      }

      h2 {
        color: var(--ink);
        font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
        font-size: clamp(34px, 5vw, 64px);
        line-height: 0.98;
        letter-spacing: 0;
      }

      .section-head p {
        max-width: 62ch;
        color: var(--soft-ink);
        font-size: 17px;
      }

      .division-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
        gap: 14px;
      }

      .division-card {
        min-height: 280px;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        justify-content: space-between;
        border: 1px solid var(--line-light);
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.66);
        padding: 24px;
        box-shadow: 0 24px 70px rgba(16, 24, 35, 0.07);
      }

      .division-card .label {
        width: fit-content;
        border-bottom: 2px solid var(--gold);
        color: var(--gold-deep);
        font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
        font-size: 28px;
        font-weight: 700;
        line-height: 1;
        padding-bottom: 6px;
      }

      .division-card h3 {
        margin-top: 24px;
        color: var(--ink);
        font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
        font-size: 28px;
        line-height: 1.06;
      }

      .division-card p {
        margin-top: 12px;
        color: var(--soft-ink);
      }

      .text-link {
        margin-top: 22px;
        color: var(--ink);
        font-weight: 750;
        border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(159, 123, 39, 0.62);
      }

      .split-proof {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
        gap: 26px;
        align-items: stretch;
      }

      .proof-panel {
        border-left: 4px solid var(--gold);
        background: rgba(255, 250, 240, 0.72);
        padding: clamp(24px, 4vw, 42px);
      }

      .proof-panel p {
        color: var(--soft-ink);
        font-size: 17px;
      }

      .proof-list {
        display: grid;
        gap: 12px;
      }

      .proof-list div {
        border: 1px solid var(--line-light);
        background: rgba(255, 250, 240, 0.7);
        padding: 16px;
        color: var(--soft-ink);
      }

      .home-footer {
        padding: 26px 0;
        background: var(--ink);
        color: rgba(255, 250, 240, 0.72);
      }

      .home-footer-inner {
        width: min(1160px, calc(100% - 40px));
        margin: 0 auto;
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 14px;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        font-size: 14px;
      }

      @media (max-width: 900px) {
        .home-hero {
          min-height: auto;
          background:
            linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(245, 240, 231, 0.94), rgba(245, 240, 231, 0.94)),
            url("/images/AboutMe.png") center top / cover no-repeat,
            var(--paper);
        }

        h1 {
          max-width: 9ch;
        }

        .section-head,
        .division-grid,
        .split-proof {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }

        .division-card {
          min-height: 0;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>

  <body>
    <header class="topbar">
      <a class="logo" href="/">
        <img src="/images/logo-dark.svg" alt={brand} class="logo-img" />
      </a>
      <nav class="nav" aria-label="Primary navigation">
        <a href="/consulting">Consulting</a>
        <a href="/design">Design</a>
        <a href="/jsi">JSI</a>
        <a href="/portfolio">Portfolio</a>
        <a href="/about">About</a>
        <a href="/blog">Insights</a>
        <a class="nav-cta" href="/contact">Contact</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section class="home-hero" aria-label="JaiSellers Companies">
        <div class="hero-inner">
          <p class="kicker">Governance. Design. Justice systems.</p>
          <h1>Structure for work that has to hold.</h1>
          <p class="lead">
            JaiSellers Companies helps mission-driven leaders turn urgent ideas into usable systems: nonprofit governance, funding infrastructure, brand identity, public-benefit programs, and the documents that keep the work moving.
          </p>
          <div class="cta-row">
            <a class="home-btn primary" href="/contact">Start a conversation</a>
            <a class="home-btn secondary" href="/jsi">View Just Systems Initiative</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section-light">
        <div class="home-container">
          <div class="section-head">
            <p class="kicker">The work</p>
            <div>
              <h2>One company, three operating lanes.</h2>
              <p>
                The common thread is structure: making important work legible, fundable, governed, designed, and ready to survive real pressure.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="division-grid">
            {divisions.map((division) => (
              <article class="division-card">
                <div>
                  <span class="label">{division.label}</span>
                  <h3>{division.title}</h3>
                  <p>{division.text}</p>
                </div>
                <a class="text-link" href={division.href}>Go to {division.label}</a>
              </article>
            ))}
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section-muted">
        <div class="home-container split-proof">
          <div class="proof-panel">
            <p class="kicker">Point of view</p>
            <h2>Clean enough to trust. Strong enough to use.</h2>
            <p>
              This is not decorative consulting. It is the practical work of putting names, roles, policies, budgets, timelines, messaging, and accountability into forms people can actually use.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="proof-list" aria-label="Representative work">
            <div>501(c)(3) formation packets, bylaws, board calendars, and grant-readiness systems.</div>
            <div>Brand systems, editorial collateral, portfolios, galleries, and campaign-ready visuals.</div>
            <div>Justice-centered program architecture for reentry, public records, civic literacy, and family connection.</div>
            <div>Plain-language tools that respect people’s intelligence and do not waste their time.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer class="home-footer">
      <div class="home-footer-inner">
        <span>© {new Date().getFullYear()} JaiSellers Companies</span>
        <span>Kings Mountain, North Carolina</span>
      </div>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>
